/// Who to invite to Live at The Cozy Cove: score 0-100 (TikTok 55, Spotify 30, other 15), its nine parts and the raw numbers (sql/026, sql/028).
table invite
	lineageTag: f1ebbbac-1284-5517-ad56-570cd722122f

	/// Spotify artist name; 4 letters of the Spotify ID are added when two artists share a name.
	column artist
