		lineageTag: 7127127d-4a5e-5026-b773-5632f45d0e7e
		sourceColumn: artist

		annotation SummarizationSetBy = User

	/// Recommend = who to invite (never played for NDN); Post or boost = NDN has the song on YouTube, or the band played for NDN before.
	column status
